gine/godot/issues/113394#issuecomment-3597498120","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113394","id":3597498120,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7WbXcI","user":{"login":"TheDying0fLight","id":95179191,"node_id":"U_kgDOBaxRtw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/95179191?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDying0fLight","html_url":"https://github.com/TheDying0fLight","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDying0fLight/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDying0fLight/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDying0fLight/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDying0fLight/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDying0fLight/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDying0fLight/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDying0fLight/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDying0fLight/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDying0fLight/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-01T16:24:24Z","updated_at":"2025-12-01T16:24:24Z","body":"In the MRP from this issue https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/35119 this is the code inside `main.tscn` for a shader:\n```\n[sub_resource type=\"Shader\" id=1]\ncode = \"shader_type spatial;\n\nvoid fragment() {\n\tif(isnan(TANGENT)) {\n\t\tALBEDO = vec3(1.0, 0.0, 0.0);\n\t}\n}\n\"\n```\nThe file received in the error message will look something like this `main.tscn::1`\n\nFor newer shaders it seems the id is generated in the pattern `Shader_` + 5 random chars (exp. Shader_0xm2m)\n\nSo for newer shaders one could maybe check if `Shader_` is contained in the file. But for older shaders this wouldn't work","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3597498120/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3597683677","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113394#issuecomment-3597683677","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113394","id":3597683677,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7WcEvd","user":{"login":"YashwanthCB","id":22799310,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNzk5MzEw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22799310?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/YashwanthCB","html_url":"https://github.com/YashwanthCB","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YashwanthCB/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YashwanthCB/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YashwanthCB/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YashwanthCB/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YashwanthCB/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YashwanthCB/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YashwanthCB/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YashwanthCB/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YashwanthCB/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-01T16:50:11Z","updated_at":"2025-12-01T16:50:11Z","body":"how was he able to create a shader with that name like `main.tscn::1` ?\nall shaders i create are generated with the pattern you told.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3597683677/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/