46,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7WcSCi","user":{"login":"YashwanthCB","id":22799310,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNzk5MzEw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22799310?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/YashwanthCB","html_url":"https://github.com/YashwanthCB","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YashwanthCB/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YashwanthCB/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YashwanthCB/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YashwanthCB/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YashwanthCB/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YashwanthCB/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YashwanthCB/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YashwanthCB/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YashwanthCB/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-01T16:58:12Z","updated_at":"2025-12-01T17:02:43Z","body":"okay. i am debugging the issue., i will try to make the obvious cases work first and then move backward to special cases like these. \nwill keep you informed. Right now, even the file name is not being passed to `ScriptEditorDebugger::_msg_error(uint64_t p_thread_id, const Array &p_data)` even when the shader is a separate file. That is why you are not able to see the file path in Error tree.\nSo it is going to be kind of a fairly complex problem to solve.\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3597738146/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3598444381","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113394#issuecomm