600181628,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Wlml8","user":{"login":"YashwanthCB","id":22799310,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNzk5MzEw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22799310?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/YashwanthCB","html_url":"https://github.com/YashwanthCB","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YashwanthCB/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YashwanthCB/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YashwanthCB/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YashwanthCB/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YashwanthCB/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YashwanthCB/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YashwanthCB/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YashwanthCB/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YashwanthCB/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-02T04:51:27Z","updated_at":"2025-12-02T04:51:27Z","body":"Are you saying the file names and other meta data are passing correctly to the event callback but the language detection still has to be worked on?","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3600181628/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3600507965","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113394#issuecomment-3600507965","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113394","id":3600507965,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Wm2Q9","user":{"login":"YashwanthCB","id":22799310,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNzk5MzEw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22799310?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/YashwanthCB","html_url":"https://github.com/YashwanthCB","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YashwanthCB/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YashwanthCB/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YashwanthCB/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YashwanthCB/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YashwanthCB/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YashwanthCB/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YashwanthCB/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YashwanthCB/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YashwanthCB/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-02T07:06:30Z","updated_at":"2025-12-02T07:11:19Z","body":"One thing i noted is all the languages held by `ScriptServer` class are scripting languages whereas gdshader (similar to, derived from, encapsulates glsl or hlsl) is a domain specific language that runs on GPU which is obvious. But the non-obvious things like memory allocation is also handled by GPU. Also we can't debug it the way we debug other scripting languages are done(with breakpoints and steppers); we need external tools to do it.\n\n Only thing that is common bw both of them is sending errors. \nWhy i am stressing this is because `ScriptLanguage` (datatype of `_languages`) contains lots of logic specific to scripting language behavior. What i feel is we have to create a separate handler classes and logic for gdshader and its specific use cases. and it can't be easily streamlined with existing `_languages` workflow. \n\nOpen to feedbacks.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3600507965/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3600632301","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113394#issuecomment-3600632301","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113394","id":3600632301,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7WnUnt","user":{"login":"TheDying0fLight","id":95179191,"node_id":"U_kgDOBaxRtw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/95179191?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDying0fLight","html_url":"https://github.com/TheDying0fLight","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDying0fLight/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDying0fLight/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDying0fLight/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDying0fLight/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDying0fLight/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDying0fLight/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDying0fLight/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDying0fLight/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDying0fLight/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-02T07:36:05Z","updated_at":"2025-12-02T07:36:05Z","body":"> Are you saying the file names and other meta data are passing correctly to the event callback but the language detection still has to be worked on?\n\nThe PR I mentioned is still open (It is for another issue but for it I also had to fix the issue you are facing, was already thinking about opening an additional PR just for those changes). So if you want to have the fix when branching from master you need to make the changes yourself.\n\n> Why i am stressing this is because `ScriptLanguage` (datatype of `_languages`) contains lots of logic specific to scripting language behavior. What i feel is we have to create a separate handler classes and logic for gdshader and its specific use cases. and it can't be easily streamlined with existing `_languages` workflow.\n\nFor my thoughts on this you can see https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112954#issuecomment-3556996207 (in the end it wasn't relevant for the issue I tried to solve, so that's everything I have). Basically my idea was register the language (which may have unwanted consequences) or add an additional hardcoded check (for `gdshader`, ...)","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3600632301/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3600681519","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113394#issuecomment-3600681519","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113394","id":3600681519,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Wngov","user":{"login":"YashwanthCB","id":22799310,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNzk5MzEw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22799310?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/YashwanthCB","html_url":"https://github.com/YashwanthCB","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YashwanthCB/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YashwanthCB/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YashwanthCB/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YashwanthCB/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YashwanthCB/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YashwanthCB/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YashwanthCB/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YashwanthCB/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YashwanthCB/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-02T07:47:30Z","updated_at":"2025-12-02T07:47:30Z","body":"> The PR I mentioned is still open (It is for another issue but for it I also had to fix the issue you are facing, was already thinking about opening an additional PR just for those changes). So if you want to have the fix when branching from master you need to make the changes yourself.\n\nI pulled those changes and now i am getting the file name but not the function name(i will look into it).\n\n> Basically my idea was register the language (which may have unwanted consequences) or add an additional hardcoded check (for gdshader, ...)\n\nYes, i saw that comment and like how you say, my take, we can't register gdshader as a ScriptingLanguage but hardcoding will also cause troubles in future.\nSo i thought of going in the middle grounds by adding extra layer for language detection. ","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3600681519/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3602094257","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113394#issuecomment-3602094257","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113394","id":3602094257,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Ws5ix","user":{"login":"YashwanthCB","id":22799310,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNzk5MzEw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22799310?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/YashwanthCB","html_url":"https://github.com/YashwanthCB","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YashwanthCB/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YashwanthCB/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://ap